Package: VariantStoryBench
Type: Package
Title: Reproducible Variant Reanalysis Benchmarks
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(
      "Sounkou Mahamane", "Toure",
      email = "sounkoutoure@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")
    )
Description: Defines reproducible input manifests, command adapters and ranking
    metrics for rare-disease variant reanalysis benchmarks. The package supports
    deterministic fixtures, declared command execution through 'blit', and
    'targets' pipelines for repeatable benchmark runs.
License: GPL-3 + file LICENSE
